{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">ROCKABILLY HOSTEL is a simple walking simulator based on pixel art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is no concept of story and/or clear the stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It is just a game for you to walking around and look around the beautiful abandoned buildings and the scenery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is nothing more about this game but it is OK as long as the</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">girls and the graphics are pretty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Two main characters can walk around seaside towns which left abandoned. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can explore the houses, the ruins, forests, beaches and various places.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586850/extras/b1.png?t=1742279355\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are pretty girls live in some abandoned buildings. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is no heart warming communication or any episode like that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy the natural communication.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586850/extras/c1en.png?t=1742279355\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586850/extras/c2en.png?t=1742279355\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Push the &quot;PHOTO &quot;button to show the pretty pictures on your display.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you go to a special place, the button turns yellow and you can see more special pictures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586850/extras/s1.png?t=1742279355\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You may find the stamps when you explore the abandoned buildings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are many kinds of the stamps to collect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Although you complete the collection, nothing will happen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586850/extras/k1en.png?t=1742279355\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3586850?t=1742279355","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586850/8e3442cc40a726cfd8085eb165d9eb513d1c14fb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742279355","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586850/f2ac46331969c4064260767f969c0d715c32adde/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742279355","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586850/f2ac46331969c4064260767f969c0d715c32adde/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742279355","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">ROCKABILLY HOSTEL is a simple walking simulator based on pixel art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is no concept of story and/or clear the stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It is just a game for you to walking around and look around the beautiful abandoned buildings and the scenery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is nothing more about this game but it is OK as long as the</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">girls and the graphics are pretty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Two main characters can walk around seaside towns which left abandoned. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can explore the houses, the ruins, forests, beaches and various places.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586850/extras/b1.png?t=1742279355\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are pretty girls live in some abandoned buildings. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is no heart warming communication or any episode like that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy the natural communication.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586850/extras/c1en.png?t=1742279355\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586850/extras/c2en.png?t=1742279355\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Push the &quot;PHOTO &quot;button to show the pretty pictures on your display.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you go to a special place, the button turns yellow and you can see more special pictures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586850/extras/s1.png?t=1742279355\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You may find the stamps when you explore the abandoned buildings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are many kinds of the stamps to collect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Although you complete the collection, nothing will happen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586850/extras/k1en.png?t=1742279355\" /></p>","developers":["Crownbird"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586850/c66840967092d0fa5fb612cd211d4bbffe744d46/header.jpg?t=1742279355","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257112545,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257112545/movie480.mp